  m_text: 'MIDNIGHT SCOUR - CREDITS


    AUDIO

    Sound effects: Zapsplat (zapsplat.com)

    Horror
    ambience music: N91music (n91music.itch.io)

    Additional sound effects: Pixabay
    (pixabay.com)


    3D MODELS  (via Sketchfab, CC Attribution)

    Corpse -
    Tamal De Quezo

    Spark Plug - Vaughan.Staehr

    Clutch LUK - SCANIMAT

    Rusty
    Locker - D3rpmaster

    Human Bone - Luar.Larep

    Wooden Closet - Mehdi Shahsavan

    Prison
    Cage - BuntyS

    Paper - otiga

    Character animations - Adobe Mixamo


    ICONS 
    (via Flaticon, www.flaticon.com)

    Opened door icon - Freepik

    Circle-dashed
    icons - Uicons by Flaticon

    Mouse icon - Iconpro86

    Social icon - pocike

    Five
    fingers icon - Kalashnyk


    ENVIRONMENT

    Textures: Poly Haven (polyhaven.com)

    Environment
    pack: Finward Studios

    Character: ZectorLab


    TOOLS

    Kino Glitch
    / Noise Shader - Keijiro Takahashi (MIT)


    Thank you for playing!'
